The model implementation and initial Web UI derive from the upstream project.
This distribution adds Chinese UI, future forecasting, gapless charts, local
file refresh, PNG export, exchange holiday filtering, and packaging.

Model weights are downloaded separately from NeoQuasar on Hugging Face;
consult the applicable model repository for its terms. Third-party market
data is downloaded at runtime and is not included in this source release.
